10 REM A FLASHCARD'S NEXT LEITNER BOX (NUTSHELL_RULES.H NS1): ANSWERED
11 REM RIGHT (R 1) IT MOVES UP ONE BOX, NEVER PAST BOX 5; ANSWERED WRONG
12 REM (R 0) IT GOES BACK TO BOX 1. B IS 1 .. 5 AND R 0 .. 1.
20 INPUT B, R
30 IF B < 1 THEN 300
40 IF B > 5 THEN 300
50 IF R < 0 THEN 300
60 IF R > 1 THEN 300
70 LET N = 1
80 IF R = 0 THEN 200
90 LET N = B + 1
100 IF N < 6 THEN 200
110 LET N = 5
200 PRINT N
210 GOTO 310
300 PRINT "REFUSED"
310 END
